<title>UK: BZW sets call warrants on UK shopping basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets call warrants on UK shopping basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 25 million American-style call warrants on a basket of UK retail shares, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>The basket consists of shares of ASDA Group Plc, Iceland Group Plc, Kwik Save Group Plc, Wm. Morrison Supermarkets Plc, Safeway Plc, J. Sainsbury Plc and Tesco Plc. One basket is controlled by one warrant.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    6.68 STG		  ISSUE PRICE  0.91 STG</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   15.JAN.99		 PAYDATE	05.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  6.68 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
